			<h2>Mature Content Description</h2>
			<p>The developers describe the content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
			Contains frequent stylised fantasy combat involving swords, bows, magic, and siege weapons. Combat depicts red blood, character deaths, ragdoll bodies, and dismemberment of humanoid characters and mounts. Visuals are deliberately blocky and non-realistic. Blood and dismemberment can be disabled in the settings.				</i>
			</p>
